  "bio": "VIOLETINE WERE A MELBOURNE INDIE ROCK BAND WITH A SOUND BUILT ON BIG GUITARS, STRONG MELODIES AND THAT SLIGHTLY DREAMY ’90S ALTERNATIVE EDGE. THEY SAT SOMEWHERE BETWEEN FUZZY ROCK, POWER POP AND SHOEGAZE, WRITING SONGS THAT FELT BOTH TOUGH AND MELODIC. MISSED THE START IS A GREAT SNAPSHOT OF A BAND THAT COULD MAKE NOISE FEEL WARM.",
